                  "text": "Int 137:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mane lumwi ndakasika kulibasibuzike baku-Telabibu, ibakakede kumu-longa wa-Kebara, nkabela ndakakala nkukonya oko nkubakakede. Ndakakala oko akati kabo cakugamba mazuba aali musanu aabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
