        {
          "text": "Alimwi muntu uululeme, na waleka bululami bwakwe akucita milimo iipilingene, aboobo ndamubikila cilebyo, lino uyoofwa. Mbuli mbotana kumucenjezya, uyoofwa muzibi zyakwe, nkabela milimo yakwe iiluleme njaakacitide tiikooyooyeeyegwa limbi, pele bulowa bwakwe ngumulandu wako. ",
